                                "sense_id": "249d2616-6a75-399c-80cd-e40c1f4b3321",
                                "text": "Here I diſcovered the ſecret Cauſes of many great Events that have ſurprized the World, how a Whore can govern the Back-ſtairs, the Back-ſtairs a Council, and the Council a Senate."
                            },
