                                "sense_id": "249d2616-6a75-399c-80cd-e40c1f4b3321",
                                "text": "1905, Ernest William Hornung, “The Spoils of Sacrilege” in A Thief in the Night,\nOther feet were already in the lower flight of the backstairs; but the upper flight was the one for me, and in an instant we were racing along the upper corridor […]"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
